      "sourceText": "| API | 类型 | 是否要求整个 buffer 完成 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `boost::asio::read()` | 同步读取 | 是，默认一直读到整个 buffer 被填满或发生错误 |\n| `serial.read_some()` | 同步读取 | 否，读取到一些数据就可以返回 |\n| `boost::asio::write()` | 同步写入 | 是，默认一直写到整个 buffer 写完或发生错误 |\n| `serial.write_some()` | 同步写入 | 否，这次实际写多少就返回多少 |",
      "translatedText": "| API | Type | Whether the entire buffer is required to be completed |\n|---|---|---|\n| `boost::asio::read()` | Synchronous read | Yes, by default it reads until the entire buffer is filled or an error occurs |\n| `serial.read_some()` | Synchronous read | No, it can return once some data has been read |\n| `boost::asio::write()` | Synchronous write | Yes, by default it writes until the entire buffer is written or an error occurs |\n| `serial.write_some()` | Synchronous write | No, it returns as much as is actually written this time |",
